{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b856220aa179ccf6","name":"Echani General Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-b856220aa179ccf6","title":"Echani General Template","revision":19115,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:20:49Z","sha256":"035447413ebed21230f6b66a2ba344e8d1ebfbd68595b8dc2b3a066c299556bc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19115","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Echani%20General%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b856220aa179ccf6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10% or 1,000 credits (whichever is higher) more than the base item\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," Armor; Weapons (Slashing or Piercing; excluding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Extremely rare, items of Echani manufacture are hand-crafted by the powerful and skilled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Echani"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Echani?action=edit&redlink=1"}," warriors, and each individual item is unique.  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," Once per encounter the wielder of an Echani Weapon can declare that the critical range of their weapon is increased by one (thus scoring a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on a Natural 19 or Natural 20 on most weapons). However, any roll other than a Natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit, and if you still miss the target you do not score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},". The use of this ability can be declared after the attack roll is made, but before the attack is resolved. However, Echani Weapons have half as many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," as other weapons of their kind.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armors:"]}," Echani Armor weighs half as much as other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," of its kind, and once per encounter the wearer can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," at their normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," (not the adjusted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," for wearing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},") for one round, though the Armor's bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," is reduced by 1.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
